      "name": "Introduction",
      "elements": [
        {
          "type": "html",
          "name": "Intro",
          "html": "\n<p>Greetings!</p>\n<p>Welcome to the <b>Earth Sciences Career Workshop Survey</b>!</p>\n<p>We, the <b>PostDoc Potential</b> and <b>Climate Dialogues Way Forward (CDWF)</b> team, are organising a career workshop for early-career researchers in earth sciences and related subjects. To this end, we want to speak with PhD scholars to gather their views on postdoctoral opportunities.</p>\n<p>The survey takes less than 5 minutes to complete and focuses on the key components we can add to our workshop. Your experience and feedback will help us in designing the workshop effectively.</p>\n<p>We kindly request you to take a few minutes to share your honest thoughts. <b>All responses will remain anonymous and will be used solely for educational and research purposes.</b></p>\n<p>Thank you for your participation!</p>\n<div class=\"contact-cards\">\n  <div class=\"contact-row\">\n    <div class=\"sig-block\">\n      <div class=\"sig-name\">Postdoc Potential</div>\n      <div class=\"sig-line\">\n        <span class=\"sig-icon\">\n          <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" fill=\"currentColor\" class=\"bi bi-globe\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\"  stroke-width=\"2.4\" >\n  <path d=\"M0 8a8 8 0 1 1 16 0A8 8 0 0 1 0 8m7.5-6.923c-.67.204-1.335.82-1.887 1.855A8 8 0 0 0 5.145 4H7.5zM4.09 4a9.3 9.3 0 0 1 .64-1.539 7 7 0 0 1 .597-.933A7.03 7.03 0 0 0 2.255 4zm-.582 3.5c.03-.877.138-1.718.312-2.5H1.674a7 7 0 0 0-.656 2.5zM4.847 5a12.5 12.5 0 0 0-.338 2.5H7.5V5zM8.5 5v2.5h2.99a12.5 12.5 0 0 0-.337-2.5zM4.51 8.5a12.5 12.5 0 0 0 .337 2.5H7.5V8.5zm3.99 0V11h2.653c.187-.765.306-1.608.338-2.5zM5.145 12q.208.58.468 1.068c.552 1.035 1.218 1.65 1.887 1.855V12zm.182 2.472a7 7 0 0 1-.597-.933A9.3 9.3 0 0 1 4.09 12H2.255a7 7 0 0 0 3.072 2.472M3.82 11a13.7 13.7 0 0 1-.312-2.5h-2.49c.062.89.291 1.733.656 2.5zm6.853 3.472A7 7 0 0 0 13.745 12H11.91a9.3 9.3 0 0 1-.64 1.539 7 7 0 0 1-.597.933M8.5 12v2.923c.67-.204 1.335-.82 1.887-1.855q.26-.487.468-1.068zm3.6